repository-code: "https://github.com/mrozali/categorical-rmt"
abstract: "Companion repository for the paper Categorical RMT (arXiv:2611.13093), released with the Agentic Publication Protocol. It contains the paper source, the exact-diagonalization code and stored spectra for the chaotic Fibonacci anyon chain and the disordered S3 qutrit chain, and scripts that reproduce the paper's figures and tables and check its numerical statements."
