  - "random matrix theory"
  - "quantum chaos"
  - "non-invertible symmetry"
  - "tube algebra"
  - "anyon chains"
  - "2d CFT"
  - "AdS3 gravity"
  - "SymTFT"
  - "spectral form factor"
